; STR History: prepared Cloudflare DNS records, checked 2026-10-06.
; Import with Cloudflare proxying disabled (DNS only).
; The apex CNAME uses Cloudflare's automatic apex flattening.
; This file does not change the registrar's authoritative nameservers.
$ORIGIN strhistory.ca.
$TTL 300
@          60   IN CNAME finprint.ethanyanxu.com.
www             IN CNAME strhistory.ca.
_dmarc          IN TXT   "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; adkim=r; aspf=r; rua=mailto:dmarc_rua@onsecureserver.net;"
_domainconnect  IN CNAME _domainconnect.gd.domaincontrol.com.
